WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.934
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:05.167
You're here. You're watching.
Thank you.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:08.934
Well, guys, big news
from Washington today

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:11.667
as President Biden
finally delivered a major update

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:14.400
on his administration's
COVID response.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.467
Yeah, just like
most phone updates,

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.200
Biden kept hitting "ignore"
until he had no choice.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.667
He was like, "Alright.
Let's just update.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.634
Give me Kilimanjaro.
Whatever it's called."

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.501
That's right.
Biden announced the U.S.

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.934
will soon make
high-quality masks available

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:29.300
to all Americans.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.868
And to be sure
that everyone wears them,

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.601
here are the new masks.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.634
It's Spidey. Yeah.

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.767
Spidey. We'll all do that.

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:38.868
That's right.
We're all getting masks.

00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:42.133
Last year, we got 1,200 bucks.

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.801
This year...

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:46.167
cloth and a rubber band.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:48.167
Yeah, I'll take it.

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:51.267
The White House says N95 masks
are the most protective,

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:53.667
which is too bad because
I assumed the bedazzled ones

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:56.968
I bought on Etsy
were 100% COVID-proof.

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:59.434
I washed it a couple times.

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:01.634
Yeah, the N95 masks
should be helpful.

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:04.367
Unfortunately, out of habit,
whenever somebody says, "N95,"

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:06.300
Biden calls it out, "Bingo!"

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.601
[ Laughs ]

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:12.234
That's the joke of the week.

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:14.133
-Come on.
-That's the joke of the week.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.567
That's the one.

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:17.701
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:19.133
Well, this is interesting.

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:22.000
I read that researchers in
Finland created a nasal spray

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.534
that they say can protect you
from all COVID variants

00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:25.901
for eight hours.

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:27.400
[ Scattered cheers ]

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.234
When asked about breathing
through your mouth,

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:33.968
the company was like, "Uhh...

00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:36.467
we didn't think of that, yeah."

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:38.868
"Oh, you're one
of those people."

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:40.334
Well, this is big news.

00:01:40.334 --> 00:01:42.901
Today, Buckingham Palace
announced that Queen Elizabeth

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:46.901
has stripped Prince Andrew of
all his royal affiliations.

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:48.534
[ Scattered cheers ]

00:01:48.534 --> 00:01:49.968
That's right.
She stripped Prince Andrew,

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:51.934
making her far and away
the oldest woman

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:53.467
to ever strip Prince Andrew.

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:55.534
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:56.701
That might be the joke --
-Oh, that might be --

00:01:56.701 --> 00:01:58.801
That might be the joke --
-That might be --

00:01:58.801 --> 00:02:01.300
-That might be the joke.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.133
-Joke of the week,
week, week, week!

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:07.434
-Go, go, go, go, go!
Go, joke!

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:10.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:12.534
Yeah, finally,
a city in California

00:02:12.534 --> 00:02:15.000
wants to use green lasers
to try and drive away

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.734
thousands of crows that have
become a public nuisance.

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:20.934
But the lasers will backfire
when thousands of crows

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:22.467
are replaced
by thousands of cats.

00:02:22.467 --> 00:02:24.133
We have a great show!

